      p.section-lead 保有する技術スタック
      
      .table-responsive
        table.btob-table
          tr
            th Languages
            td C/C++, C#, JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, VBA (Excel), HTML, CSS, R
          tr
            th Frameworks & Libraries
            td Node.js, Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS
          tr
            th Environment & Tools
            td
              strong OS:
              |  Windows, Ubuntu
              br
              strong Infra:
              |  AWS, Docker
              br
              strong DB:
              |  PostgreSQL, DynamoDB
              br
              strong Tool:
              |  Git, GitHub, VS Code
              br
              strong Hardware:
              |  Raspberry Pi, Arduino, PLC (Sequence Control), OPC Server
              br
              strong Engineering:
              |  はんだ付け, モータ制御
          tr
            th 資格・免許
            td
              | JDLA Deep Learning for GENERAL (G検定)
              br
              | 普通自動車第一種運転免許
              br
              | 基本情報技術者

  section#works.section
    .container
      h2.section-title Works
      p.section-lead 主要な実績とアウトプット

